concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "Note: A court can also refuse to make a restraining order if the Commonwealth refuses to give an undertaking: see section 21.  (4A) If the court refuses to make a *restraining order under subsection (1), it may make any order as to costs it considers appropriate, including costs on an indemnity basis. Risk of property being disposed of etc.  (5) The court may make a *restraining order even if there is no risk of the property being disposed of or otherwise dealt with. Later acquisitions of property  (6) The court may specify that a *restraining order covers property that is acquired by the *suspect after the court makes the order. Otherwise, no property that is acquired after a court makes a restraining order is covered by the order." ;
    skos:definition "Note: A court can also refuse to make a restraining order if the Commonwealth refuses to give an undertaking: see section 21.  (4A) If the court refuses to make a *restraining order under subsection (1), it may make any order as to costs it considers appropriate, including costs on an indemnity basis. Risk of property being disposed of etc.  (5) The court may make a *restraining order even if there is no risk of the property being disposed of or otherwise dealt with. Later acquisitions of property  (6) The court may specify that a *restraining order covers property that is acquired by the *suspect after the court makes the order. Otherwise, no property that is acquired after a court makes a restraining order is covered by the order."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8cbd13c684c4552c7a42518501abff97afd514eac420593a8c737a9a0c9f26be" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-6-ss-4a ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-6-ss-5 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-6-ss-6 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.10" .
doc:sch-1-sec-6 a cof:Section ;
