concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-29a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29A Court may exclude property from a restraining order made"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-29a ;
    values:originalText "under section 20A  The court to which an application for a *restraining order under section 20A was made may, when the order is made or at a later time, exclude specified property from the order if:  (a) an application is made under section 30 or 31; and  (b) the court is satisfied that:  (i) the property is property of a person other than the *suspect; and  (ii) the property is not subject to the *effective control of the suspect. Note: Section 32 may prevent the court from hearing the application until the DPP has had a reasonable opportunity to conduct an examination of the applicant. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Unexplained wealth  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010" ;
    skos:definition "under section 20A  The court to which an application for a *restraining order under section 20A was made may, when the order is made or at a later time, exclude specified property from the order if:  (a) an application is made under section 30 or 31; and  (b) the court is satisfied that:  (i) the property is property of a person other than the *suspect; and  (ii) the property is not subject to the *effective control of the suspect. Note: Section 32 may prevent the court from hearing the application until the DPP has had a reasonable opportunity to conduct an examination of the applicant. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Unexplained wealth  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "44a86eb857b6719023565c0cc8194d56e77185515902923eebf1e694f399377c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Court may exclude property from a restraining order made under section 20A." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
