concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179ea a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "179EA Refusal to make an order for failure to give undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-179ea ;
    values:originalText "(1) The court may refuse to make a *preliminary unexplained wealth order or an *unexplained wealth order if the Commonwealth refuses or fails to give the court an appropriate undertaking with respect to the payment of damages or costs, or both, for the making and operation of the order.  (2) The *DPP may give such an undertaking on behalf of the Commonwealth." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The court may refuse to make a *preliminary unexplained wealth order or an *unexplained wealth order if the Commonwealth refuses or fails to give the court an appropriate undertaking with respect to the payment of damages or costs, or both, for the making and operation of the order.  (2) The *DPP may give such an undertaking on behalf of the Commonwealth."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2471728b4e408a2168ed00cad9e759b60b5cfb30aa1bc0bd5daa8f2c6b58792e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179ea-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179ea-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.16" .
