concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179j cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179j-logic-alleninterval-2 .
