concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179p a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "179P Additional application for an unexplained wealth order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-179p ;
    values:originalText "(1) The *DPP cannot, unless the court gives leave, apply for an *unexplained wealth order against a person if:  (a) an application has previously been made for an unexplained wealth order in relation to the person; and  (b) the application has been finally determined on the merits.  (2) The court must not give leave unless it is satisfied that:  (a) the *wealth to which the new application relates was identified only after the first application was determined; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Unexplained wealth  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010  (b) necessary evidence became available only after the first application was determined; or  (c) it is in the interests of justice to give the leave." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The *DPP cannot, unless the court gives leave, apply for an *unexplained wealth order against a person if:  (a) an application has previously been made for an unexplained wealth order in relation to the person; and  (b) the application has been finally determined on the merits.  (2) The court must not give leave unless it is satisfied that:  (a) the *wealth to which the new application relates was identified only after the first application was determined; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Unexplained wealth  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010  (b) necessary evidence became available only after the first application was determined; or  (c) it is in the interests of justice to give the leave."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "24ca5523d85f2e6722117423f5bb4476da9ce5216de4b1239ed69bd7f739e02d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179p-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179p-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
