    values:originalText "(2) The court must not give leave unless it is satisfied that:  (a) the *wealth to which the new application relates was identified only after the first application was determined; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Unexplained wealth  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010  (b) necessary evidence became available only after the first application was determined; or  (c) it is in the interests of justice to give the leave." ;
