    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) a person is subject to an *unexplained wealth order; and  (b) the *DPP applies to the court for an order under this section; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 1  Unexplained wealth" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) a person is subject to an *unexplained wealth order; and  (b) the *DPP applies to the court for an order under this section; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 1  Unexplained wealth"@en ;
