concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-29 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29 At the end of section 335"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-29 ;
    values:originalText "Add: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Unexplained wealth  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010 Preliminary unexplained wealth orders and unexplained wealth orders  (7) The courts that have proceeds jurisdiction for a *preliminary unexplained wealth order or an *unexplained wealth order are those of any State or Territory with jurisdiction to deal with criminal matters on indictment." ;
    skos:definition "Add: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Unexplained wealth  Schedule 1 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010 Preliminary unexplained wealth orders and unexplained wealth orders  (7) The courts that have proceeds jurisdiction for a *preliminary unexplained wealth order or an *unexplained wealth order are those of any State or Territory with jurisdiction to deal with criminal matters on indictment."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d3e1aabbc89087e24d803b37449c3ea9cf9b8f696c8851f10226c92bd6045c8e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "States and Territories with jurisdiction to deal with criminal matters on indictment have proceeds jurisdiction for preliminary unexplained wealth orders or unexplained wealth orders." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
