concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-28 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "28 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-28 ;
    values:originalText "(b) a magistrate is satisfied that, unless the order is made, there is a risk that the balance of the account will be reduced so that a person will not be deprived of all or some of the proceeds or instrument." ;
