    values:originalText "(1) The magistrate may complete and sign the same form of *freezing order that would be made under section 15B if satisfied that:  (a) a freezing order should be issued urgently; or  (b) the delay that would occur if an application were made in person would frustrate the effectiveness of the order." ;
