concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-30-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30(3) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-30-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The applicant must then:  (a) complete a form of *freezing order in terms substantially corresponding to those given by the magistrate; and  (b) state on the form:  (i) the name of the magistrate; and  (ii) the day on which the order was signed; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime  Schedule 2 Freezing orders  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010  (iii) the time at which the order was signed." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The applicant must then:  (a) complete a form of *freezing order in terms substantially corresponding to those given by the magistrate; and  (b) state on the form:  (i) the name of the magistrate; and  (ii) the day on which the order was signed; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime  Schedule 2 Freezing orders  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010  (iii) the time at which the order was signed."@en ;
