concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-15k a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15K Freezing order does not prevent withdrawal to enable financial"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-15k ;
    values:originalText "institution to meet its liabilities  A *freezing order relating to an *account with a *financial institution does not prevent the institution from allowing a ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 2  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime" ;
    skos:definition "institution to meet its liabilities  A *freezing order relating to an *account with a *financial institution does not prevent the institution from allowing a ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 2  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime"@en ;
