concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 Application of amendments of sections 18 and 19"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments of sections 18 and 19 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 made by this Part apply in relation to applications made on or after the commencement of the amendments for a restraining order, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement." ;
    skos:definition "The amendments of sections 18 and 19 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 made by this Part apply in relation to applications made on or after the commencement of the amendments for a restraining order, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement."@en ;
