    skos:prefLabel "16 Paragraph 47(1)(c)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-16 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (c) the court is satisfied that a person whose conduct or suspected conduct formed the basis of the restraining order engaged in conduct constituting one or more *serious offences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime  Schedule 2 Removal of 6-year time limit  Part 2  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (c) the court is satisfied that a person whose conduct or suspected conduct formed the basis of the restraining order engaged in conduct constituting one or more *serious offences. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime  Schedule 2 Removal of 6-year time limit  Part 2  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010"@en ;
