concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-29 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29 Application of amendments of section 116"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-29 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments of section 116 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 made by this Part apply in relation to applications made on or after the commencement of the amendments for a pecuniary penalty order, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement." ;
    skos:definition "The amendments of section 116 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 made by this Part apply in relation to applications made on or after the commencement of the amendments for a pecuniary penalty order, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement."@en ;
