concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-49 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "49 At the end of section 47"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-49 ;
    values:originalText "Add: Refusal to make a forfeiture order  (4) Despite subsection (1), the court may refuse to make an order under that subsection relating to property that the court is satisfied:  (a) is an *instrument of a *serious offence other than a *terrorism offence; and  (b) is not *proceeds of an offence; if the court is satisfied that it is not in the public interest to make the order." ;
    skos:definition "Add: Refusal to make a forfeiture order  (4) Despite subsection (1), the court may refuse to make an order under that subsection relating to property that the court is satisfied:  (a) is an *instrument of a *serious offence other than a *terrorism offence; and  (b) is not *proceeds of an offence; if the court is satisfied that it is not in the public interest to make the order."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "120676e7834b5323522af251e75f93f3b5c49fb8ad9bdf78da349403c4f0047b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "49"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Court may refuse to make forfeiture order under certain conditions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
