doc:sch-2-sec-60 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "60 Application of amendments of sections 73 and 85" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The amendments of sections 73 and 85 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 made by this Part apply in relation to forfeiture orders applied for on or after the commencement of the amendments, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement." ;
    cof:pageNumber "51"^^xsd:integer .

