concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-266a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "266A Disclosure"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-266a ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if a person obtains information:  (a) as a direct result of: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime  Schedule 2 Disclosure of information  Part 4  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010  (i) the person being given a sworn statement under an order made under paragraph 39(1)(d); or  (ii) the exercise of a power (by the person or someone else), or performance (by the person) of a function, under" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if a person obtains information:  (a) as a direct result of: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime  Schedule 2 Disclosure of information  Part 4  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010  (i) the person being given a sworn statement under an order made under paragraph 39(1)(d); or  (ii) the exercise of a power (by the person or someone else), or performance (by the person) of a function, under"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "767c1bcbb95aecbbf658f8dd37d3740fa2e27d878c76890f9df46fc237e4bbfc" ;
    cof:pageNumber "52"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Disclosure of information required for obtaining a sworn statement under an order." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
