concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15gc a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15GC Definitions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15gc ;
    values:originalText "In this Part: ACC authorising officer has the meaning given by subsection 15GF(4). ACLEI authorising officer has the meaning given by subsection 15GF(5). AFP authorising officer has the meaning given by subsection 15GF(3). appropriate authorising officer, for a controlled operation authorised under this Part, means the following:  (a) if the authority to conduct the controlled operation was granted by an AFP authorising officer—any AFP authorising officer;  (b) if the authority to conduct the controlled operation was granted by an ACC authorising officer—any ACC authorising officer;  (c) if the authority to conduct the controlled operation was granted by an ACLEI authorising officer—any ACLEI authorising officer. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
    skos:definition "In this Part: ACC authorising officer has the meaning given by subsection 15GF(4). ACLEI authorising officer has the meaning given by subsection 15GF(5). AFP authorising officer has the meaning given by subsection 15GF(3). appropriate authorising officer, for a controlled operation authorised under this Part, means the following:  (a) if the authority to conduct the controlled operation was granted by an AFP authorising officer—any AFP authorising officer;  (b) if the authority to conduct the controlled operation was granted by an ACC authorising officer—any ACC authorising officer;  (c) if the authority to conduct the controlled operation was granted by an ACLEI authorising officer—any ACLEI authorising officer. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "151b5bf84c1381bd1a078f0d105c8927db8fb6be27d10466ecc3ddb82a551ab9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "63"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Definitions for controlled operations" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.63" ;
