concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-70 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-70 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Nothing in this Part prevents an authority being granted in respect of a controlled operation that has been the subject of a previous authority, but in that case the subsequent authority must be a formal authority. Note: An urgent authority can be varied, but not so as to extend its duration—see sections 15GO and 15GS." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Nothing in this Part prevents an authority being granted in respect of a controlled operation that has been the subject of a previous authority, but in that case the subsequent authority must be a formal authority. Note: An urgent authority can be varied, but not so as to extend its duration—see sections 15GO and 15GS."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "90989ab014002ca019fbb3ff8e415730865dfdc1ae9944d816dfd36624352885" ;
    cof:pageNumber "74"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Subsequent authority must be formal if granted in respect of a controlled operation with previous authority." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
