concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15go-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15GO(2) Variation of authority by appropriate authorising officer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15go-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A variation may:  (a) extend the period of effect of the authority (subject to subsections (3) and (4)); or  (b) authorise additional persons to engage in controlled conduct for the purposes of the controlled operation and specify:  (i) with respect to additional law enforcement participants—the nature of the controlled conduct that those participants may engage in; and  (ii) with respect to additional civilian participants—the particular controlled conduct (if any) that each such participant may engage in; or  (c) provide that specified persons are no longer authorised to engage in controlled conduct for the purposes of the controlled operation; or  (d) authorise participants in the controlled operation to engage in additional or alternative controlled conduct." ;
    skos:definition "(2) A variation may:  (a) extend the period of effect of the authority (subject to subsections (3) and (4)); or  (b) authorise additional persons to engage in controlled conduct for the purposes of the controlled operation and specify:  (i) with respect to additional law enforcement participants—the nature of the controlled conduct that those participants may engage in; and  (ii) with respect to additional civilian participants—the particular controlled conduct (if any) that each such participant may engage in; or  (c) provide that specified persons are no longer authorised to engage in controlled conduct for the purposes of the controlled operation; or  (d) authorise participants in the controlled operation to engage in additional or alternative controlled conduct."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1fe3d8075638b519e99cda2049294277b61d583b984ae1d027c6e82c9f204826" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15go ;
