concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15gp-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15GP(7) Application to appropriate authorising officer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15gp-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) The authorising officer to whom the application is made may require the applicant to provide such information concerning the proposed variation as is necessary for the authorising officer’s proper consideration of the application." ;
    skos:definition "(7) The authorising officer to whom the application is made may require the applicant to provide such information concerning the proposed variation as is necessary for the authorising officer’s proper consideration of the application."@en ;
