concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-78 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-78 ;
    values:originalText "(d) state the date and time when the variation of authority is or was granted; and  (e) describe the variation having regard to the matters referred to in subsection 15GO(2); and  (f) if the variation extends the period of effect of a formal authority—state the period of the extension.  (2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(f), the period of the extension must not exceed:  (a) in the case of a formal variation of authority—the period that would result in the period of effect of the authority exceeding 3 months (including any previous extensions); and  (b) in the case of an urgent variation of authority—the lesser of:  (i) 7 days; and  (ii) a period that would result in the period of effect of the authority exceeding 3 months (including any previous extensions). Subdivision C—Variations of authorities by nominated Tribunal member: extensions beyond 3 months" ;
    skos:definition "(d) state the date and time when the variation of authority is or was granted; and  (e) describe the variation having regard to the matters referred to in subsection 15GO(2); and  (f) if the variation extends the period of effect of a formal authority—state the period of the extension.  (2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(f), the period of the extension must not exceed:  (a) in the case of a formal variation of authority—the period that would result in the period of effect of the authority exceeding 3 months (including any previous extensions); and  (b) in the case of an urgent variation of authority—the lesser of:  (i) 7 days; and  (ii) a period that would result in the period of effect of the authority exceeding 3 months (including any previous extensions). Subdivision C—Variations of authorities by nominated Tribunal member: extensions beyond 3 months"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cf32ea3266f2235fef56d0c55bb2fd5464f1b040d98b590a393c3e8f0c881caf" ;
    cof:pageNumber "82"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Provide details about a variation of authority, including date and time, description, and period of extension." ;
    dc:description "true" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.82" ;
    cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-78-norm .
