doc:sch-3-sec-82 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "82 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "formal variation of authority may affect the success of the controlled operation;  orally in person, or by telephone or any other means of communication (such a variation is an urgent variation of authority).  (2) The nominated Tribunal member must, as soon as practicable, prepare and give a written document that complies with section 15GX to the applicant." ;
