concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15gy a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15GY Cancellation of authorities"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15gy ;
    values:originalText "(1) An appropriate authorising officer may, by order in writing given to the principal law enforcement officer for a controlled operation, ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection  Schedule 3 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010 cancel the authority to conduct the controlled operation at any time and for any reason.  (2) Without limiting subsection (1), an appropriate authorising officer may cancel an authority at any time at the request of the principal law enforcement officer for the controlled operation concerned.  (3) Cancellation of an authority takes effect at the time the order is made or at the later time specified in the order." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An appropriate authorising officer may, by order in writing given to the principal law enforcement officer for a controlled operation, ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection  Schedule 3 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010 cancel the authority to conduct the controlled operation at any time and for any reason.  (2) Without limiting subsection (1), an appropriate authorising officer may cancel an authority at any time at the request of the principal law enforcement officer for the controlled operation concerned.  (3) Cancellation of an authority takes effect at the time the order is made or at the later time specified in the order."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "98d83c85d820197570bf787efe756cecbd70784ef3a719e81d9e84d25ce37786" ;
    cof:pageNumber "86"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15gy-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15gy-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15gy-ss-3 ;
