concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15hi a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15HI Effect of section 15HH on other laws relating to criminal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15hi ;
    values:originalText "investigation  Section 15HH does not apply to a person’s conduct that is, or could have been, authorised under a Commonwealth law or a law of a State or Territory relating to the following:  (a) arrest or detention of individuals; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
