concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15hs-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15HS(5) Inspection of records by the Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15hs-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Nothing in this section requires the Ombudsman to inspect records relating to operations that have not been completed at the time of the inspection. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection  Schedule 3 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010" ;
    skos:definition "(5) Nothing in this section requires the Ombudsman to inspect records relating to operations that have not been completed at the time of the inspection. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection  Schedule 3 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9678aedbaa615599751d3918b81e5bc624d6ea233d4071f64ed429e4328b2af2" ;
