doc:sch-3-sec-15kb-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15KB(5) Determination of applications" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) An authority may also authorise any one or more of the following:  (a) an application of a kind referred to in section 15KG for an order for an entry in a register of births, deaths or marriages under a corresponding assumed identity law;  (b) a request under section 15KI or 15KX;  (c) the use of an assumed identity in a foreign country. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
