doc:sch-3-sec-15kg a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15KG Making entries in register of births, deaths or marriages" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The chief officer of:  (a) a law enforcement agency; or  (b) an intelligence agency; may apply, under a corresponding assumed identity law, to the Supreme Court of a State or Territory of a participating jurisdiction for an order that an entry be made in a register of births, deaths or marriages under the relevant law of that jurisdiction in relation to the acquisition of an assumed identity under an authority or corresponding authority." ;
    cof:pageNumber "123"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15kh a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15KH Effect of authority ceasing to be in force on register of births,"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15kh ;
    values:originalText "deaths or marriages  (1) This section applies if:  (a) an authority for an assumed identity ceases to be in force; and  (b) there is an entry in relation to that assumed identity in a register of births, deaths or marriages because of an order under a corresponding assumed identity law. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
    skos:definition "deaths or marriages  (1) This section applies if:  (a) an authority for an assumed identity ceases to be in force; and  (b) there is an entry in relation to that assumed identity in a register of births, deaths or marriages because of an order under a corresponding assumed identity law. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0750564531bdefc1193be9d0f39bb21f0517a96a62af1da993d8f0464c8ea28d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "123"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Register of births, deaths or marriages must be updated when an authority ceases to be in force." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
