concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15kw-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15KW(3) Consequences of transfer of control of authorities"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15kw-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The following provisions have effect, after the transfer, as if the chief officer of the receiving agency had granted the authority instead of the chief officer of the originating agency:  (a) section 15KE (which deals with variation and cancellation of authorities);  (b) section 15KF (which deals with review of authorities);  (c) sections 15KI and 15KX (which deal with requests for evidence of assumed identities). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection  Schedule 3 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The following provisions have effect, after the transfer, as if the chief officer of the receiving agency had granted the authority instead of the chief officer of the originating agency:  (a) section 15KE (which deals with variation and cancellation of authorities);  (b) section 15KF (which deals with review of authorities);  (c) sections 15KI and 15KX (which deal with requests for evidence of assumed identities). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection  Schedule 3 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2244e7377bf8e738f264c9125fd0f1d7bbdb4add8c5a17708b6ee55deb5cdcf4" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15kw ;
    cof:pageNumber "130"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Conditional commencement of certain provisions after transfer of control" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
