    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15kw-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Section 15KL (which deals with cancellation of evidence of assumed identity) has effect as if the chief officer of the receiving agency had made the request under section 15KI." ;
    skos:definition "(5) Section 15KL (which deals with cancellation of evidence of assumed identity) has effect as if the chief officer of the receiving agency had made the request under section 15KI."@en ;
