concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15kx a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15KX Requests to a participating jurisdiction for evidence of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15kx ;
    values:originalText "assumed identity  (1) This section applies if an authority granted under section 15KB authorises a request under this section.  (2) The chief officer of a law enforcement agency or an intelligence agency who grants the authority may request the chief officer of an issuing agency of a participating jurisdiction stated in the authority to:  (a) produce evidence of the assumed identity in accordance with the authority; and  (b) give evidence of the assumed identity to the following:  (i) the authorised person named in the authority;  (ii) an officer of the law enforcement agency or the intelligence agency who is named in the request. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
    skos:definition "assumed identity  (1) This section applies if an authority granted under section 15KB authorises a request under this section.  (2) The chief officer of a law enforcement agency or an intelligence agency who grants the authority may request the chief officer of an issuing agency of a participating jurisdiction stated in the authority to:  (a) produce evidence of the assumed identity in accordance with the authority; and  (b) give evidence of the assumed identity to the following:  (i) the authorised person named in the authority;  (ii) an officer of the law enforcement agency or the intelligence agency who is named in the request. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "53975c8037963ac3c56ebc4845a2b03053492abb166b2c7391d34bf86798588a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "131"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15kx-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15kx-ss-2 ;
