concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15la a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15LA Application of this Part to authorities under corresponding"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15la ;
    values:originalText "laws  (1) The following provisions apply to anything done in relation to a corresponding authority as if it were an authority granted under section 15KB:  (a) section 15KP (assumed identity may be acquired and used);  (b) section 15KT (particular qualifications);  (c) section 15KU (effect of being unaware of variation or cancellation of authority);  (d) section 15LB (misuse of assumed identity);  (e) section 15LC (disclosing information about assumed identity).  (2) Sections 15KN, 15KQ and 15KR apply to anything done in relation to a corresponding authority as if:  (a) the corresponding authority were an authority granted under section 15KB; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
    skos:definition "laws  (1) The following provisions apply to anything done in relation to a corresponding authority as if it were an authority granted under section 15KB:  (a) section 15KP (assumed identity may be acquired and used);  (b) section 15KT (particular qualifications);  (c) section 15KU (effect of being unaware of variation or cancellation of authority);  (d) section 15LB (misuse of assumed identity);  (e) section 15LC (disclosing information about assumed identity).  (2) Sections 15KN, 15KQ and 15KR apply to anything done in relation to a corresponding authority as if:  (a) the corresponding authority were an authority granted under section 15KB; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8954b4ce200e1b10594592fbed1a8ba405c3e70d3a3ae2909815f7b5cdaf992c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "133"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15la-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15la-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.133" .
doc:sch-3-sec-15la a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15LA Application of this Part to authorities under corresponding" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "laws  (1) The following provisions apply to anything done in relation to a corresponding authority as if it were an authority granted under section 15KB:  (a) section 15KP (assumed identity may be acquired and used);  (b) section 15KT (particular qualifications);  (c) section 15KU (effect of being unaware of variation or cancellation of authority);  (d) section 15LB (misuse of assumed identity);  (e) section 15LC (disclosing information about assumed identity).  (2) Sections 15KN, 15KQ and 15KR apply to anything done in relation to a corresponding authority as if:  (a) the corresponding authority were an authority granted under section 15KB; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
    cof:pageNumber "133"^^xsd:integer .

