concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ma a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15MA Meaning of criminal proceeding"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15ma ;
    values:originalText "(1) In this Part, criminal proceeding means a proceeding for the prosecution, whether summarily or on indictment, of an offence or offences.  (2) To avoid doubt, each of the following is part of a criminal proceeding:  (a) a bail proceeding;  (b) a committal proceeding; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
    skos:definition "(1) In this Part, criminal proceeding means a proceeding for the prosecution, whether summarily or on indictment, of an offence or offences.  (2) To avoid doubt, each of the following is part of a criminal proceeding:  (a) a bail proceeding;  (b) a committal proceeding; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection"@en ;
