concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15me a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15ME Witness identity protection certificate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15me ;
    values:originalText "(1) The chief officer of a law enforcement agency may give a witness identity protection certificate for an operative in relation to a proceeding if:  (a) the operative is, or may be required, to give evidence in the proceeding; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The chief officer of a law enforcement agency may give a witness identity protection certificate for an operative in relation to a proceeding if:  (a) the operative is, or may be required, to give evidence in the proceeding; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c6b9583a860cd628032ae126f7533cc9213328aa04991b5a45cac5d939811582" ;
