concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15mm a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15MM Disclosure of operative’s identity etc. despite certificate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15mm ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if a witness identity protection certificate for an operative in relation to a proceeding is filed in a court.  (2) A party to the proceeding, or a lawyer assisting the court in the proceeding, may apply to the court:  (a) for leave:  (i) to ask a question of a witness, including the operative, that may lead to the disclosure of the operative’s identity or where the operative lives; or  (ii) for a person involved in the proceeding to make a statement that discloses, or may lead to the disclosure of, the operative’s identity or where the operative lives; or  (b) for an order requiring a witness, including the operative, to answer a question, give evidence or provide information that ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if a witness identity protection certificate for an operative in relation to a proceeding is filed in a court.  (2) A party to the proceeding, or a lawyer assisting the court in the proceeding, may apply to the court:  (a) for leave:  (i) to ask a question of a witness, including the operative, that may lead to the disclosure of the operative’s identity or where the operative lives; or  (ii) for a person involved in the proceeding to make a statement that discloses, or may lead to the disclosure of, the operative’s identity or where the operative lives; or  (b) for an order requiring a witness, including the operative, to answer a question, give evidence or provide information that ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "088b39a938f3d41231d0ed5805b173e4adc855cb6d49d0caa82a1c76e08bd04d" ;
