concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-148-ss-5 cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-148-ss-5-logic-ltl-3 .
