concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-148-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "148(9) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-148-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) To avoid doubt, subsection (8) does not prevent the taking of a transcript of court proceedings, but the court may make an order for how the transcript is to be dealt with, including an order suppressing its publication." ;
    skos:definition "(9) To avoid doubt, subsection (8) does not prevent the taking of a transcript of court proceedings, but the court may make an order for how the transcript is to be dealt with, including an order suppressing its publication."@en ;
