concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-148-ss-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "148(10) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-148-ss-10 ;
    values:originalText "(10) The court may make any other order it considers appropriate to protect the operative’s identity or to prevent the disclosure of where the operative lives." ;
    skos:definition "(10) The court may make any other order it considers appropriate to protect the operative’s identity or to prevent the disclosure of where the operative lives."@en ;
