concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15mn a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15MN Application for leave—joinder as respondent"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15mn ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if:  (a) a witness identity protection certificate for an operative in relation to a proceeding is filed in a court; and  (b) a person applies:  (i) for leave under section 15MI or 15MM; or  (ii) for an order under section 15MK or 15MM.  (2) The court in which the application is pending may allow a person to join the application as a respondent if:  (a) the person is:  (i) the operative in relation to whom the witness identity protection certificate is given; or  (ii) the chief officer of the agency who gave the witness identity protection certificate; and  (b) the person applies to be joined to the application as a respondent; and  (c) the person has sufficient interest in the subject matter of the application. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if:  (a) a witness identity protection certificate for an operative in relation to a proceeding is filed in a court; and  (b) a person applies:  (i) for leave under section 15MI or 15MM; or  (ii) for an order under section 15MK or 15MM.  (2) The court in which the application is pending may allow a person to join the application as a respondent if:  (a) the person is:  (i) the operative in relation to whom the witness identity protection certificate is given; or  (ii) the chief officer of the agency who gave the witness identity protection certificate; and  (b) the person applies to be joined to the application as a respondent; and  (c) the person has sufficient interest in the subject matter of the application. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "427d86531075e94e9530c3d7e6cad2672072f66d3547d463cb2e83b245525f15" ;
    cof:pageNumber "153"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15mn-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15mn-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.153" .
