concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ms-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15MS(3) Disclosure offences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15ms-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person commits an offence if:  (a) a witness identity protection certificate for an operative in relation to a proceeding has been given; and  (b) the certificate has not been cancelled under section 15MQ; and  (c) the person engages in conduct; and  (d) the conduct results in the disclosure of the operative’s identity or where the operative lives; and  (e) none of the following applies:  (i) the conduct is required by section 15ML;  (ii) the conduct is authorised by leave or by an order under section 15MM;  (iii) the conduct is permitted under section 15MR; and  (f) the person is reckless as to whether his or her conduct will:  (i) prejudice any current or future investigation; or  (ii) prejudice any current or future activity relating to security. Penalty: Imprisonment for 10 years. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
    skos:definition "(3) A person commits an offence if:  (a) a witness identity protection certificate for an operative in relation to a proceeding has been given; and  (b) the certificate has not been cancelled under section 15MQ; and  (c) the person engages in conduct; and  (d) the conduct results in the disclosure of the operative’s identity or where the operative lives; and  (e) none of the following applies:  (i) the conduct is required by section 15ML;  (ii) the conduct is authorised by leave or by an order under section 15MM;  (iii) the conduct is permitted under section 15MR; and  (f) the person is reckless as to whether his or her conduct will:  (i) prejudice any current or future investigation; or  (ii) prejudice any current or future activity relating to security. Penalty: Imprisonment for 10 years. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cde17757e166ea8b7b0314ffa2f88e0bd2ec5b0c85c1b00d1ec4e0638c53f2e9" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ms ;
    cof:pageNumber "156"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Disclosing operative identity or location without authorization is prohibited." ;
