osure of, an operative’s identity, or where the operative lives, unless the witness identity protection certificate for the operative has been cancelled.  (4) The Minister must cause a copy of the report to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the day on which the Minister receives the report." ;
