    values:originalText "(4) The Minister must cause a copy of the report to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the day on which the Minister receives the report." ;
    cof:pageNumber "158"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15mw a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15MW Recognition of witness identity protection certificates under"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15mw ;
    values:originalText "corresponding laws  The following provisions apply, with any necessary changes, to a corresponding witness identity protection certificate as if it were a witness identity protection certificate given under section 15ME:  (a) section 15MH (filing and notification);  (b) section 15MI (leave for non-compliance);  (c) section 15MJ (effect of witness identity protection certificate);  (d) section 15MK (orders to protect operative’s identity etc.); ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection" ;
    skos:definition "corresponding laws  The following provisions apply, with any necessary changes, to a corresponding witness identity protection certificate as if it were a witness identity protection certificate given under section 15ME:  (a) section 15MH (filing and notification);  (b) section 15MI (leave for non-compliance);  (c) section 15MJ (effect of witness identity protection certificate);  (d) section 15MK (orders to protect operative’s identity etc.); ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115  Schedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity protection"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "340c51ff9a335f273b80d67a13489878cca8d7dedf60f0d91b74ee297ff5a634" ;
    cof:pageNumber "159"^^xsd:integer ;
