    values:originalText "Insert: criminal organisation means an organisation (whether incorporated or not, and however structured) that is:  (a) a declared organisation within the meaning of:  (i) the Crimes (Criminal Organisations Control) Act 2009 of New South Wales; or  (ii) the Serious and Organised Crime (Control) Act 2008 of South Australia; or  (b) an organisation of a kind specified by or under, or described or mentioned in, a prescribed provision of a law of a State or Territory." ;
