    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-172 ;
    values:originalText "(v) the performance of a function or duty, or the exercise of a power, by a person, court or other body under, or in relation to a matter arising under, an organised crime control law of that State; or" ;
    skos:definition "(v) the performance of a function or duty, or the exercise of a power, by a person, court or other body under, or in relation to a matter arising under, an organised crime control law of that State; or"@en ;
